 "words": 195,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The LORD restored his fortunes once again",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Gave him twice as much as he had before",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "His brothers and sisters came to his house",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To console and comfort him in his pain",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Each gave him a piece of silver and gold",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A ring from the hand of one who knew",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD blessed the latter part of his life",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "More than the first he had known",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keren-happuch is the third of the daughters",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Named by the hand of God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No women in the land were as beautiful",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As these three in his grace",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He had seven sons and three daughters",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Born when his joy returned to him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jemimah first and Keziah second",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Keren-happuch came after",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keren-happuch is the third of the daughters",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Named by the hand of God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No women in the land were as beautiful",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As these three in his grace",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their father granted them an inheritance",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Among their brothers in the land",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A justice and generosity seen",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the blessing of his house",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Job lived a hundred and forty years",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saw his children to the fourth generation",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And so he died old and full of days",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the peace of the Lord",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
 ],
